  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The de facto open-source CGM data platform with 73k forks reflecting extraordinary real-world deployment since 2013. Provides the data layer that Loop, AndroidAPS, and Trio integrate with for remote monitoring and data sharing. REST and GraphQL APIs enable research pipeline integration. AGPL-3.0 copyleft applies to embedding in proprietary products. Adopt for any diabetes research programme or clinical team supporting patients using DIY AID or needing real-time remote CGM visibility.",
